1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 13=

34
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,320
Where did these stinky monks come from?

35
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:00,360
What the hell?

36
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,400
Those beggars reek.

37
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,680
What on earth is going on?

38
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:04,600
Mr. Ke.

39
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,320
Congratulations.

40
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,160
Oh.

41
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,360
You're here.

42
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,080
Please, come inside.

43
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,120
- Come on in, come on in.
- (Let's go.)

44
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:10,240
Hey.

45
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,000
- How did they get inside?
- Don't rush.

46
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,480
Sir.

47
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,480
It's these monks causing trouble.

48
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,400
How many times have I told you?

49
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,400
When you meet monks,

50
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,800
you should build good karma with them.

51
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:20,840
But

52
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,280
I've already given them money.

53
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,040
They insisted on coming
to the wedding banquet.

54
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,240
May I ask where you holy monks are from?

55
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,320
We come from Lingyin Temple.

56
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,720
We heard that you're known
for your kindness and generosity.

57
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,120
Since your family is celebrating
a wedding today,

58
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,320
we came to offer our congratulations.

59
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,040
And while we're here,

60
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:40,520
perhaps we could have a cup
of wedding wine.

61
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,960
So you're esteemed monks
from Lingyin Temple.

62
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,480
Very well.

63
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:44,880
Please, come inside. Come inside.

64
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,360
Great!

65
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:53,520
Hua.

66
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,200
Prepare the medicine according
to this prescription.

67
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,560
Use it in place of pearls

68
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,560
to make Rouge Snow.

69
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,720
See how effective it is,

70
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:00,920
and report back to me immediately.

71
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,440
Yes.

72
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,560
The auspicious hour has arrived.

73
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,480
Time for the wedding ceremony!

74
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,840
(Double Happiness)
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

75
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,040
Second bow to the parent.

76
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:33,520
Third bow to each other.

77
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,640
The ceremony is complete!

78
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,480
Escort the bride and groom

79
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:47,200
to the bridal chamber!

80
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:51,760
Hey!

81
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,400
Wait.

82
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,520
Don't leave so soon.

83
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,480
Mr. Ke.

84
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,640
Let the groom have a few drinks with us.

85
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,480
Of course, of course.

86
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,680
Let my beloved son-in-law

87
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,880
toast everyone.

88
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,760
Great!

89
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:04,480
Great!

90
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:05,680
Here!

91
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,320
A toast to everyone!

92
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,760
Enjoy the food and drinks.

93
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,960
Alas.

94
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:12,920
Hmm?

95
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:16,680
So...

96
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,360
Huh?

97
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,000
Is seeing someone else get married

98
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,560
bringing back memories?

99
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,160
Don't say nonsense.

100
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,680
Congratulations, congratulations!

101
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,360
Congratulations!

102
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:29,520
These are esteemed monks
from Lingyin Temple.

103
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,200
They came especially
to bless your marriage.

104
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,160
Master.

105
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,880
This man looks just like Yuan Zushou.

106
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,360
Even reincarnation wouldn't happen
that fast.

107
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:37,640
Huh?

108
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,360
Yuan Zushou?

109
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,040
Yes.

110
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:39,960
Really?

111
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,480
I'm Shen Lang.

112
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,400
My surname is not Yuan.

113
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:42,960
Okay.

114
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,360
A toast to all the venerable masters.

115
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,240
Yeah.

116
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,640
Come on, everyone.

117
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,960
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

118
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,640
Please enjoy the feast, holy masters.

119
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,880
Amitabha Buddha.

120
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:07,480
Xing.

121
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,640
Go outside and take a look.

122
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,360
When you get a chance, tell my father

123
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,880
not to let Shen Lang drink too much.

124
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:14,720
Yes.

125
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,160
My lady, what's wrong?

126
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,240
Why does my stomach suddenly hurt?

127
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,440
What if later

128
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,880
I get a stomachache in front
of Shen Lang?

129
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,240
He'll make fun of me.

130
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,840
On the wedding night,

131
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,400
when her love reaches its peak,

132
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,000
when Ms. Ke's chest begins to glow red,

133
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,400
I'll strike in one swift move,

134
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,905
and then

135
00:05:43,906 --> 00:05:45,320
I can save my benefactor.

136
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,720
I've sacrificed so much
for my benefactor.

137
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,680
Once he sees how much I've done for him,

138
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,200
he'll marry me.

139
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,040
He'll give me

140
00:05:53,041 --> 00:05:54,720
a wedding even grander than today's.

141
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,360
Then,

142
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,840
I'll be the happiest person
in the world.

143
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,520
No.

144
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,800
I have to use the restroom

145
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,120
before Shen Lang returns.

146
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,360
Where is Ms. Ke?

147
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,600
(Slow down, Mr. Shen.)

148
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,240
(You really can't hold your liquor.)

149
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,120
(You're already drunk.)

150
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,400
I'm not drunk.

151
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,440
I don't need you here.

152
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,000
Go enjoy the drinks.

153
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,560
Sure.

154
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:22,280
My dear, why did you lie down
without waiting for me?

155
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,520
Let me get undressed and join you.

156
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,200
(I'm doomed.)

157
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:29,240
(My chastity belongs to my benefactor.)

158
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,000
(I can't lose my virginity here.)

159
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:34,920
Ouch!

160
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:35,720
Ow!

161
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,240
Huh?

162
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,360
Darling.

163
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,040
Why are you bleeding?

164
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,320
Something's wrong.

165
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,440
Could her period have arrived early?

166
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,000
Wait here.

167
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,760
I'll get Cui and Xing.

168
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,240
Cui!

169
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,600
Xing!

170
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,040
Ouch!

171
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,320
My luck is not with me today.

172
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,200
I'll return another day.

173
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:22,760
Ow!

174
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:26,760
Oh.

175
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,280
I've long heard that Lingyin Temple
has great monks.

176
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,680
It is an honor to finally meet you.

177
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,240
Sweetheart,

178
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,640
offer the monks a toast.

179
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:32,800
Wait.

180
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,440
Everyone, stop drinking for now.

181
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,640
I have something to say.

182
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:38,720
Mr. Ke.

183
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:39,980
Everyone here

184
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:41,280
is a loyal customer of your family.

185
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,840
Your Rouge Snow

186
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,760
has made you unrivaled in the market,

187
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,100
leaving competitors like me

188
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:46,200
with no business.

189
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,240
However,

190
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,440
I heard recently that

191
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:52,520
top-quality pearls are now
nearly impossible to find.

192
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,960
Without the raw materials,

193
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,360
your Rouge Snow

194
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,000
will soon be out of stock.

195
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,160
Am I right

196
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,280
or not?

197
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:00,080
Well...

198
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,600
I thought it was something serious.

199
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,280
But it doesn't seem to have anything
to do with us.

200
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,120
Alas!

201
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,520
Are you deliberately picking a fight?

202
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,280
How does this concern you?

203
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,320
Don't tell me

204
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,960
you're one of the Ke family too.

205
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:14,800
You...

206
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,040
Hmph.

207
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:17,800
Mr. Ke.

208
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:18,480
Ah?

209
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,040
Looks like there's a show to watch.

210
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,240
Everyone,

211
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:33,720
don't listen to her nonsense.

212
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:34,880
Those are just rumors.

213
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,400
Today,

214
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,480
my daughter is getting married.

215
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,720
Everyone here

216
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,240
will receive a box

217
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,280
of the finest Rouge Snow.

218
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,320
Wow!

219
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,000
Wonderful!

220
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,240
That's great!

221
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,960
Mr. Ke is truly generous.

222
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,400
Hmph.

223
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:51,840
Holy monk,

224
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,040
please accept this small token
of my appreciation.

225
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:53,840
Wow.

226
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,040
- Thank you, thank you.
- Amitabha Buddha.

227
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,760
Rouge is useless to us monks.

228
00:09:58,760 --> 00:09:59,880
Well,

229
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,640
if you don't want it, I'll take it.

230
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,040
- Hey!
- Give them all to me!

231
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,160
Wait, wait!

232
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,000
Hey.

233
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,800
What?

234
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,120
Don't give me that!

235
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,080
I'll step out for a moment.
I'll be right back.

236
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,720
Where is he rushing off to?

237
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,120
Celestial maiden Yanzhi.

238
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,080
Celestial maiden Yanzhi.

239
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,200
Hey.

240
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,520
Dragon-Subduing Arhat,

241
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,520
what brings you here?

242
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:26,920
Well, you see...

243
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:32,920
I remember when you were in Heaven,

244
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:36,240
you said you wanted to try rouge
from the mortal realm.

245
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:36,880
Yes.

246
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,240
Today,

247
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,120
Mr. Ke is celebrating
his daughter's wedding.

248
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,920
He gave me a box.

249
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:44,160
So I especially

250
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,200
brought it here for you.

251
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,720
Wonderful!

252
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,280
This is the finest rouge

253
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,960
in Lin'an City.

254
00:10:59,160 --> 00:10:59,960
Oh my heavens.

255
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,240
It smells amazing.

256
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,720
What smells so wonderful?

257
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:03,960
Hmm?

258
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:04,680
Huh?

259
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:07,960
Your Majesty.

260
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,480
Your Majesty.

261
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,440
What smells so wonderful?

262
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,160
Oh.

263
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,920
This is the rouge Dragon-Subduing
Arhat brought back.

264
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:21,500
I've long heard that rouge
from the mortal world

265
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:22,440
has a unique charm.

266
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,480
At least you have some filial devotion.

267
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,920
You still remembered me.

268
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:32,400
Oh.

269
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,200
Yes.

270
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,200
Your Majesty,

271
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,640
this rouge

272
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:36,760
was specially

273
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:37,920
offered to you by Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

274
00:11:39,690 --> 00:11:41,203
(Rouge Snow)

275
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,280
Yanzhi.

276
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:44,640
Yes?

277
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,360
You may leave.

278
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,720
I need to speak with him.

279
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,600
Yes.

280
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,480
The other day, when we drove away
Erlang Shen,

281
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:05,560
it was mainly my adopted son's
achievement,

282
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,400
but you did lend a hand.

283
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,520
And today, you brought me this rouge.

284
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,960
I am truly pleased.

285
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,560
So I have decided to...

286
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:20,840
So...

287
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:22,360
Hmm?

288
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,120
So I have decided...

289
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:27,960
Huh?

290
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:30,560
Ah?

291
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:31,320
Hey.

292
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,240
So I have decided

293
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,520
to thank you, my sweetheart.

294
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,760
What are you doing, Your Majesty?

295
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,240
You aren't trying to frame me again,
are you?

296
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,600
"Your Majesty"?

297
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,400
- I'm your little sweetheart.
- Don't be ridiculous.

298
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:40,920
Please.

299
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:41,680
Let me go.

300
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,240
Jade Emperor?

301
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,080
What are you two...

302
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,800
Hi.

303
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:46,560
Jade Emperor...

304
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:47,760
Uh...

305
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,040
We weren't doing anything.

306
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:51,840
I was hoping we could make peace

307
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,640
and invite you back to Heaven.

308
00:12:54,313 --> 00:12:58,760
I never thought you'd end up with him.

309
00:12:59,040 --> 00:12:59,920
Hurry. Go away.

310
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:00,760
Stay away from me.

311
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:03,120
So everything Erlang Shen said was true.

312
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,280
Just you wait.

313
00:13:06,566 --> 00:13:08,286
I will bring down heavenly punishment
upon you.

314
00:13:08,344 --> 00:13:09,280
Alright, alright.

315
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:10,400
Stop it, stop it.

316
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:10,760
Enough.

317
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,880
- Oh...
- Come play.

318
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:14,400
Ugh.

319
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:16,800
Ugh!

320
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:17,200
Ah!

321
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,120
Oh, no! Oh, no!

322
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:19,840
Something's wrong!

323
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:27,790
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

324
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:31,050
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

325
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,850
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

326
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:37,880
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

327
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:45,090
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

328
00:13:45,110 --> 00:13:48,640
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

329
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:58,550
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

330
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:01,810
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

331
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:05,120
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

332
00:14:05,130 --> 00:14:06,810
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

333
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:08,730
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

334
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:10,290
♪I left my wife behind♪

335
00:14:10,430 --> 00:14:11,890
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

336
00:14:11,930 --> 00:14:15,710
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

337
00:14:15,770 --> 00:14:16,850
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

338
00:14:16,860 --> 00:14:18,950
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

339
00:14:18,990 --> 00:14:20,650
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

340
00:14:20,690 --> 00:14:22,520
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

341
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:25,880
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

342
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:29,150
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

343
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:32,280
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

344
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:35,650
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

345
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:39,310
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

346
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:42,660
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

347
00:14:42,700 --> 00:14:45,770
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

348
00:14:46,350 --> 00:14:49,400
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

349
00:14:49,420 --> 00:14:52,840
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

350
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:56,400
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

351
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:59,880
♪You're just wasting your time♪

352
00:14:59,930 --> 00:15:02,850
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

353
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:04,510
♪And I just laugh happily♪

354
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:07,920
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

